      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Stack: 2KB goroutine (grows)\nHeap: flat, non-generational\nGC: concurrent mark-sweep\nSafety: memory safe\nParallelism: M:N threading (GMP)\nKey: simplicity + predictability",
