      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Stack: ~1MB V8 call stack\nHeap: V8 New Space + Old Space\nGC: V8 generational (Orinoco)\nSafety: memory safe (JS runtime)\nParallelism: single thread + I/O\nKey: async I/O, not CPU-bound",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Stack: ~1MB V8 call stack\nHeap: V8 New Space + Old Space\nGC: V8 generational (Orinoco)\nSafety: memory safe (JS runtime)\nParallelism: single thread + I/O\nKey: async I/O, not CPU-bound",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
